## Upstream and vendored code

QuestCalibrator is based on OpenVR-SpaceCalibrator by Justin Li (pushrax).
Those portions were received under the MIT License below, which continues to
apply to them and must be retained; the original, unrestricted project remains
available at https://github.com/pushrax/OpenVR-SpaceCalibrator. No code from
other forks of OpenVR-SpaceCalibrator is included; ideas credited to other
forks in the README were reimplemented independently. MinHook is vendored
under its own BSD-2-Clause license (lib/MinHook/LICENSE).

